        "created_at": "2025-02-22T04:53:43.450Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You are cutting the line wherever there is a <code>\"</code> character. If you cut a rope <span class=\"math\">4</span> times, you get <span class=\"math\">5</span> pieces of rope, hope that is clear.<br>\nIf you cut the line with <code>\"</code>, things on left of the first <code>\"</code> is the first field. This is the spaces at the start of the line, before the first <code>\"</code>.</p>\n<p>Also, please use code fences wherever possible in discourse.</p>",
